    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just so exhausted and the thought of going to a hospital or waiting in an er right now sounds like a nightmare... i literally just want to sleep it off. u sure it couldnt just be from sitting so long? i mean the calf is just a bit swollen and the chest thing is mostly just when i take a huge breath. it's probably just my circulation being slow from the flight, right?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
